test "checker: child narrows public to private instance ÃÂ¢ÃÂÃÂ TS2415" {
    // Mirrors `derivedClassWithPrivateInstanceShadowingPublicInstance` ÃÂ¢ÃÂÃÂ
    // parent declares `public x`, child re-declares `private x`. TS
    // treats this as TS2415 because the child's nominal `private x`
