    // (`...[[k1, v1], [k2, v2]]` → `[[any, any], [any, any]]`). tsc
    // reports only the arity error (TS2554); the unfilled tuple positions
    // are an arity problem, so the single provided arg is not
    // additionally type-checked against the tuple. Mirrors
    // `iterableArrayPattern25`.
