// ÃÂÃÂ§TS2700 ÃÂ¢ÃÂÃÂ an object-rest binding (`{ ...r } = x`) over a non-object
// source surfaces "Rest types may only be created from object types.".
// Symmetric to the existing TS2698 spread check; mirrors
// `restInvalidArgumentType.ts` (`var {...r12} = num;` // Error).
